<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Basic Minecraft auto-crystaler. Holding right click will place and destroy crystals automatically (you can change the speed in which this happens by changing the delay in the cose) It is Default set to a certain delay to be undetected . I personally found this very useful, hopefully it can help you too.

I have another program which can place the obsidian with a click of a button aswell, message me if you would like that.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>RightDown 1
Delay 30 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 35 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 43 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 50 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 30 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 45 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 48 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 40 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Minecraft</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>